flowchart LR
    Request[Caller-controlled stable-core request]
    Agent[Agent or host adapter]
    MCP[MCP adapter]
    Pi[Pi extension]
    CLI[Public MAINFRAME CLI]
    Local[Caller-local sequencing]
    Broker[Legacy stable-core broker]
    Policy[Policy and invocation registry]
    Output[Raw result returned to caller]
    Partial[(Partial local records)]

    Request --> Agent
    subgraph CallerBoundary[Caller-owned process boundary]
        Agent --> MCP
        Agent --> Pi
        MCP --> Local
        Pi --> Local
        CLI --> Local
    end
    Local -. reserve / invoke / record .-> Partial
    Local --> Broker
    Broker --> Policy
    Broker --> Output
    Local -. crash windows and retry ambiguity .-> Broker
